# ── Firmware build artifacts ───────────────────────────
# PlatformIO creates these the first time you build.
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/

# ── Windows junk ───────────────────────────────────────
# Explorer drops these into folders it has previewed,
# such as dist/assets/images/.
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ── Note ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# conn.php is intentionally NOT ignored. It holds the stock
# XAMPP defaults (root / no password / localhost), and the
# same values are hardcoded in three API files anyway.
